  "description": {
   "text": "Magic Resistance\n(Alteration)\n\nLevel: 5\nSphere: Protection\nRange: Touch\nDuration: 3 rounds + 1 round/level\nCasting Time: 5\nArea of Effect: 1 creature\nSaving Throw: None\n\nWhen this spell is cast, the recipient receives a resistance to all magic. The resistance conferred is 2% per level of the caster, up to a maximum of 40% at 20th level. This resistance is added to any Magic Resistance the target already has, and casting the spell again on the same creature replaces the previous casting. This effect will last for the duration of the spell or until dispelled.",
